INFO 2026-04-22 01:29:07,383 accounts.api_io [request_id=02121959-42A4-4C20-8B3C-4D9ADAF8C2FB] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=8 bytes=3995 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjJUMDE6MTY6MjQuNDEwMDQ2KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzQzIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "7d467207-47d1-46ff-9731-d470fe72b821", "server_message_id": "b96ab4d8-7d7b-41c7-b747-bcd450cfaef2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:16:13.843000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:16:13.930855+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "CBE9721E-3302-48FE-A5ED-6B7097BF971F", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260422/212872A0-60C1-446F-AEE1-07220D447B74/IMG_1812.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY25-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "fileId": 286, "fileMd5": "de257a30b3e928fa067b0df812b1f8cb", "objectKey": "SparkClient/20260422/212872A0-60C1-446F-AEE1-07220D447B74/IMG_1812.jpeg", "fullCacheKey": "212872a0-60c1-446f-aee1-07220d447b74/IMG_1812.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是你最新的结膜炎处方，我已经帮你提炼了关键信息并保存为用药卡片，整理用药要点如下：\n\n1.  **用药方案**\n    - 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）：每日滴眼4次，每次1滴\n    - 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）：每日滴眼2次，每次1滴\n\n2.  **重要提醒**\n    两种滴眼液开封后，使用都不能超过**4周**，超过时间请丢弃，避免滋生细菌引发眼部感染。\n\n用药期间如果眼睛瘙痒、红肿、异物感持续加重，或者用药3天没有明显缓解，记得及时回眼科复诊。", "client_message_id": "4f5bdb7f-dd2e-4cdb-911c-79b125d9fdff", "server_message_id": "7c0b9985-524f-483b-ae8c-cc2a1a5006c8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:16:24.408000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:16:24.410046+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "0F88E6B0-B0A8-457C-965E-73F260105339", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "45633480-3C09-4707-8B6B-D974B99D3FA4", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "665917A2-EF75-412E-9B2B-6DBAB2172551", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "2C587375-7482-4832-9B19-98BBEE6454BE", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
