INFO 2026-04-22 01:54:50,723 accounts.api_io [request_id=D62744A0-8988-4F53-98A1-25901B2EB6C0] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2ODIzMDg3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzY4MjEyODcsImp0aSI6Ijc4YzUwY2MwNzZiNTQ5YWNhZDMzOTg5Njk2Njk2Zjk1IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.oMqexj71BS6rHICJlf_TkiD165IBrKHC41-Rqdvy7bM", "X-Request-Id": "D62744A0-8988-4F53-98A1-25901B2EB6C0", "Content-Length": "2176"} body={"messages": [{"kind": "text", "content": "你好😊！根据你的处方信息，诊断为结膜炎，目前使用两种滴眼液：\n1.  **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）**：每日滴眼4次，每次1滴。\n2.  **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**：每日滴眼2次，每次1滴，开启后请在**4周内用完**。\n\n用药期间请注意眼部卫生，避免揉眼，如果症状没有缓解或加重，建议及时复诊。", "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_id": "F3594FC7-33AD-4940-BE5B-0D8315566336", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:54:50.714Z", "delivery_state": "pending", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "attachments": [{"type": "toolName", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "id": "523641EB-106B-4E17-96C8-4E5A2CE5D19A"}, {"type": "toolContent", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "id": "5B54E607-B403-497B-9BDE-BAF131F95D8D"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "id": "5E6469E3-2DFF-4F17-9402-ED0904556D15", "type": "operationalState"}, {"text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "id": "1C5466A0-D63A-472E-B53F-33EF88F206CC", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "thread_max_messages": 20, "tombstone": f