INFO 2026-04-22 01:54:53,755 accounts.api_io [request_id=5F648DA4-FC10-4EFD-9837-CE637E0AE9F5] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=4 bytes=4546 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjBUMjM6NDA6MTUuMTE3MzU5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMjg3In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "785e0f3f-0d5b-454e-87fe-e75437335878", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "867f8bea-79b6-40b7-919b-0d32cd36fc6d", "server_message_id": "e42bc841-4a3b-46d7-8c63-70c029a22019", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-20T23:38:53.652000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-20T23:38:53.644449+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "785e0f3f-0d5b-454e-87fe-e75437335878", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀！我是你的Spark健康助手，很高兴为你服务！😊\n\n我看到你的健康档案中最近有一条医疗报告记录（2026年4月18日的检查报告）。我可以帮助你：\n\n- 查看和分析健康数据（步数、睡眠、营养、运动等）\n- 管理健康相关的日历和提醒事项\n- 创建健康计划和任务\n- 整理和分析医疗信息\n- 搜索健康相关的知识和资源\n\n今天有什么我可以帮你的吗？比如想了解最近的健康情况，还是有其他健康相关的问题？", "client_message_id": "9cbdfa86-d4a6-426b-8239-9fe1c8fdbf54", "server_message_id": "23c06039-7bf2-4055-9767-1999fd2bc814", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-20T23:39:05.163000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-20T23:39:05.060845+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "8D42FC69-59E4-48E2-B0BF-49B6092477D0", "text": "get_current_member", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "EF3DF35E-F0FB-4375-B24F-61FC389E397D", "text": "[1] get_current_member\n当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "97136DB6-0C52-43EF-873B-AE347F5F32C3", "text": "正在使用工具：get_current_member", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "38FA5BFB-01A3-4F00-A35B-0BF9B3A36EE6", "text": "当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": "用户打了招呼\"你好呀\"。作为Spark健康助手，我应该友好回应，并询问用户需要什么帮助。同时，根据病历摘要，成员最近有一条2026年4月18日的医疗报告检查报告。我可以先了解一下当前成员的基本情况。\n\n让我先调用get_current_member来获取当前成员信息。然后根据用户的问候进行回应。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 2075, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "785e0f3f-0d5b-454e-87fe-e75437335878", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "不错不错", "client_message_id": "6ccd494f-09bc-49e1-913f-2bfaec0276a5", "server_message_id": "fca26262-d436-490f-a077-c4de9d448dda", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-20T23:40:08.871000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-20T23:40:08.825773+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "785e0f3f-0d5b-454e-87fe-e75437335878", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "很高兴你觉得不错！😊\n\n既然你已经有医疗报告记录，我可以为你提供更个性化的健康建议。比如：\n\n1. **健康数据分析**：查看你最近的步数、睡眠、营养摄入情况\n2. **医疗报告分析**：如果你上传了检查报告，我可以帮你分析关键指标\n3. **健康计划制定**：根据你的需求制定运动、饮食或睡眠计划\n4. **任务管理**：设置健康相关的提醒和任务\n\n你比较想了解哪个方面呢？或者有其他特定的健康问题需要咨询？", "client_message_id": "de8ffa0b-dacc-4478-89ca-adcfe3ca1276", "server_message_id": "3bc34d45-2718-448a-a0c9-fe2b795dd304", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-20T23:40:15.213000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-20T23:40:15.117359+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户回复\"不错不错\"，听起来像是对我之前的问候表示认可，但并没有具体的问题或需求。我需要主动提供一些帮助方向，引导对话。我可以询问用户是否想了解最近的健康数据，或者是否有特定需求。考虑到用户可能有医疗报告记录，我可以询问是否想了解更多关于健康分析的内容。现在我应该用友好的语气回应，提供一些具体的帮助选项。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 2185, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
