INFO 2026-04-22 01:54:54,311 accounts.api_io [request_id=5BAECDC6-A7D7-41AF-9B4A-A9A1A0E8503D] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=7 bytes=5348 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjJUMDE6NTI6MTkuMjg5NzQ1KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzU1In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "28809058-3266-48eb-b040-6331761d36a3", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你虎牙", "client_message_id": "1656b436-1f86-4c8b-9665-27005a799569", "server_message_id": "394dec66-1864-4797-b4c0-73c7c61de981", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:51:41.418000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:51:41.523517+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "5770C61D-06DB-4B88-9947-39854EFB185D", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260422/A19292A5-742C-4186-83F2-4DB254E27F70/IMG_1812.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY25-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "fileId": 294, "fileMd5": "de257a30b3e928fa067b0df812b1f8cb", "fullCacheKey": "a19292a5-742c-4186-83f2-4db254e27f70/IMG_1812.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "28809058-3266-48eb-b040-6331761d36a3", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "根据您上传的门诊处方，为您整理用药信息如下：\n\n**诊断：结膜炎**\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）** 5ml:5mg，每日4次，每次1滴，滴眼。\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）** 6ml:3mg，每日2次，每次1滴，滴眼。\n\n**💡 重要提醒：**\n- 两种滴眼液开封后，使用请勿超过4周，超过请丢弃。\n- 滴眼时请注意瓶口不要接触眼睛，避免污染药液。\n\n请问您具体有什么眼部不适症状吗？我可以为您提供更针对性的建议。", "client_message_id": "be6d301d-cc22-4450-a3bb-226632e2132d", "server_message_id": "dacd07bf-711a-4458-9310-200b4ef002c2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:51:55.786000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:52:19.289745+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "D1593A4C-0AEF-4772-A5AB-EAE483BFB84B", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "D2C8A2FD-2756-42AC-93BB-1C6D1188E798", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "45B81AF9-6C48-4089-8223-49563A544DD1", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "84029ABE-550E-4476-95CD-263091B4D4C5", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "2D6CA967-D1DA-44EA-9E23-E552BBA5C306", "text": "{\"medicalCases\":[],\"examReports\":[],\"medications\":[],\"prescriptions\":[{\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"结膜炎\\\",\\\"medications\\\":[{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"普南扑灵\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日四次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"5ml:5mg\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"4\\\"},{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"爱赛平\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日两次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"2\\\"}],\\\"prescribedAt\\\":\\\"2026-04-20\\\"}\",\"isSaved\":false,\"memberID\":21,\"subtitle\":\"结膜炎\",\"id\":\"C4E21683-8C47-4DE4-9CE4-8337047531C1\",\"ossFileId\":294,\"title\":\"处方\"}]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
