INFO 2026-04-22 01:54:54,333 accounts.api_io [request_id=467006C8-5389-4D54-A763-966DDEA492DA] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=4 bytes=5198 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjJUMDE6NTQ6NTAuODE5NTMwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzU3In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "f3594fc7-33ad-4940-be5b-0d8315566336", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "6ae36738-44fc-4ead-91c6-116580d18551", "server_message_id": "89013a23-4ae9-4e9a-9312-708117331a36", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:54:37.044000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:54:37.144275+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "35188E3E-D699-423B-BFE8-186CFDE1BEC7", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260422/07AE6DD4-53BE-43E2-BAF8-31AC982D1C84/IMG_1812.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY25-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "fileId": 295, "fileMd5": "de257a30b3e928fa067b0df812b1f8cb", "fullCacheKey": "07ae6dd4-53be-43e2-baf8-31ac982d1c84/IMG_1812.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3594fc7-33ad-4940-be5b-0d8315566336", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊！根据你的处方信息，诊断为结膜炎，目前使用两种滴眼液：\n1.  **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）**：每日滴眼4次，每次1滴。\n2.  **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**：每日滴眼2次，每次1滴，开启后请在**4周内用完**。\n\n用药期间请注意眼部卫生，避免揉眼，如果症状没有缓解或加重，建议及时复诊。", "client_message_id": "efa988a8-3d9f-43a6-84d0-403d15155686", "server_message_id": "72f613fb-90f6-4bf6-b147-ec63cd659a99", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:54:50.714000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:54:50.819530+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "523641EB-106B-4E17-96C8-4E5A2CE5D19A", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "5B54E607-B403-497B-9BDE-BAF131F95D8D", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "5E6469E3-2DFF-4F17-9402-ED0904556D15", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "1C5466A0-D63A-472E-B53F-33EF88F206CC", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "04B978AF-F01F-4CCB-A4B7-96C7B332B1D4", "text": "{\"medications\":[],\"prescriptions\":[{\"isSaved\":false,\"memberID\":21,\"title\":\"处方\",\"id\":\"5FA6C558-5D3C-4D78-924C-9EA31A435EA1\",\"subtitle\":\"结膜炎\",\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"结膜炎\\\",\\\"medications\\\":[{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"普南扑灵\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日四次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"5ml:5mg\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"4\\\"},{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"爱赛平\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\\\",\\\"frequencyCode\\\":\\\"bid\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日两次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"6ml:3mg (0.05%)\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"2\\\"}],\\\"prescribedAt\\\":\\\"2026-04-20\\\"}\",\"ossFileId\":295}],\"examReports\":[],\"medicalCases\":[]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
