INFO 2026-04-22 01:56:55,679 accounts.api_io [request_id=2968AB48-0734-4BDD-B264-AF5611A4843B] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2ODIzMDg3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzY4MjEyODcsImp0aSI6Ijc4YzUwY2MwNzZiNTQ5YWNhZDMzOTg5Njk2Njk2Zjk1IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.oMqexj71BS6rHICJlf_TkiD165IBrKHC41-Rqdvy7bM", "X-Request-Id": "2968AB48-0734-4BDD-B264-AF5611A4843B", "Content-Length": "1198"} body={"messages": [{"tombstone": false, "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:56:55.671Z", "thread_role_prompt": "", "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-lite-260215", "thread_top_p": 1, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "role": "assistant", "content": "这份胃镜报告显示：**慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流**，其他食管、贲门、十二指肠等部位未见明显异常。\n\n慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流是常见的消化系统问题，给你几个日常建议：\n1. **饮食调整**：避免暴饮暴食，减少高脂肪、甜食、咖啡、酒精等刺激胆汁分泌的食物，睡前避免进食\n2. **生活习惯**：进食后不要立即平躺，戒烟限酒，避免过度紧张焦虑\n3. **定期随访**：如果有胃痛、胃胀、反酸等不适，建议消化科就诊，医生可能会根据症状给予促胃动力、保护胃黏膜等药物治疗\n\n请问你目前有胃部不适的症状吗？", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "reasoning_expanded": false, "thread_id": "2F4320AB-17E8-4AEE-8DAC-92F69122286F", "thread_max_messages": 20, "delivery_state": "pending", "attachments": [], "client_message_id": "B53EBC72-D0A4-4C31-B980-D49B96344366", "kind": "text", "thread_max_tokens": 4096}]}
