INFO 2026-04-22 01:57:18,849 accounts.api_io [request_id=5182B800-BA8E-4EA1-AEA3-12D6A4B6EB5A] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=9 bytes=4722 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjJUMDE6NTc6MTQuMjM4NzgxKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzYzIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "2f4320ab-17e8-4aee-8dac-92f69122286f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀事实上", "client_message_id": "598588c7-a930-4f44-a9ab-83d0371eb344", "server_message_id": "73608a8d-46a1-44c9-a190-ff7d1e6691c3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:56:50.310000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:56:50.374287+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "053F4F59-A6EC-4717-A406-23A1AC892186", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260422/01D954E5-4F8E-4247-BAC6-A4913850B19B/342395b5cd7bf2dad1ea494355711848.pdf", "text": "苏州大学附属第四医院\n苏州市独墅湖医院\n胃镜诊断报告单\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n年龄：28 岁\n申请科室：消化内科门诊\n门诊号：0000349056\n住院号：\n床号：\n病区：\n检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含麻醉费）\n申请单号：260821105\n①食管\n②齿状线\n③胃底\n①胃体\n⑤胃角\n6胃窦\n⑦十二指肠球部\n⑧十二指肠降部\n内镜所见：\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\n贲门：开合佳通畅；\n胃底：黏膜正常；\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\n胃角：光整；\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红沩主；\n幽门：圆，开放好；\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\n诊断：\n慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n活检部位：\n建议：\n报告医生：\n审核医师：产州的\n报告时间：2026-02-10\n备注：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！", "type": "pdf", "fileId": 297, "fileMd5": "98c76af8cdbe6b67f5918596c76803b8", "fullCacheKey": "01d954e5-4f8e-4247-bac6-a4913850b19b/342395b5cd7bf2dad1ea494355711848.pdf"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "2f4320ab-17e8-4aee-8dac-92f69122286f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这份胃镜报告显示：**慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流**，其他食管、贲门、十二指肠等部位未见明显异常。\n\n慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流是常见的消化系统问题，给你几个日常建议：\n1. **饮食调整**：避免暴饮暴食，减少高脂肪、甜食、咖啡、酒精等刺激胆汁分泌的食物，睡前避免进食\n2. **生活习惯**：进食后不要立即平躺，戒烟限酒，避免过度紧张焦虑\n3. **定期随访**：如果有胃痛、胃胀、反酸等不适，建议消化科就诊，医生可能会根据症状给予促胃动力、保护胃黏膜等药物治疗\n\n请问你目前有胃部不适的症状吗？", "client_message_id": "b53ebc72-d0a4-4c31-b980-d49b96344366", "server_message_id": "98915c0d-f94a-48d2-8030-4a6063db2976", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:56:55.671000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:56:55.687223+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "2f4320ab-17e8-4aee-8dac-92f69122286f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这什么", "client_message_id": "aa10e3c3-76df-4b22-a496-ee3fd370fcf3", "server_message_id": "914247fd-97d5-4b8b-bba4-57923a114d8d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:57:10.929000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:57:10.983371+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "FB486FA6-91F3-4F5E-A72C-315426D99A49", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260422/4AC7E644-FE6B-46C3-9A3F-5374FC404D70/IMG_1810.jpeg", "text": "安格斯MAX厚牛堡\nVRrga", "type": "image", "fileId": 298, "fileMd5": "b7e459135d64dc92e28f941b6d3d81a2", "fullCacheKey": "4ac7e644-fe6b-46c3-9a3f-5374fc404d70/IMG_1810.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "2f4320ab-17e8-4aee-8dac-92f69122286f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是麦当劳的**安格斯MAX厚牛堡**，属于一款汉堡产品，主要特点是使用了较厚的牛肉饼。\n\n需要我帮你查询这款汉堡的热量和营养成分吗？", "client_message_id": "cde516b0-739d-49cd-936c-b9f225ca1f3b", "server_message_id": "903c3f28-d640-4d24-89a7-c0a1278c0da4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:57:14.214000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T01:57:14.238781+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
