INFO 2026-04-22 12:27:23,359 accounts.api_io [request_id=D32002FF-8F4A-4890-8038-1AABA3986701] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=6 bytes=4241 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjJUMDY6NDQ6MTAuMzUxMzY5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzQzIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是你最新的结膜炎处方，我已经帮你提炼了关键信息并保存为用药卡片，整理用药要点如下：\n\n1.  **用药方案**\n    - 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）：每日滴眼4次，每次1滴\n    - 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）：每日滴眼2次，每次1滴\n\n2.  **重要提醒**\n    两种滴眼液开封后，使用都不能超过**4周**，超过时间请丢弃，避免滋生细菌引发眼部感染。\n\n用药期间如果眼睛瘙痒、红肿、异物感持续加重，或者用药3天没有明显缓解，记得及时回眼科复诊。", "client_message_id": "4f5bdb7f-dd2e-4cdb-911c-79b125d9fdff", "server_message_id": "7c0b9985-524f-483b-ae8c-cc2a1a5006c8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T01:16:24.408000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T06:44:10.351369+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "0F88E6B0-B0A8-457C-965E-73F260105339", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "45633480-3C09-4707-8B6B-D974B99D3FA4", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "665917A2-EF75-412E-9B2B-6DBAB2172551", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "2C587375-7482-4832-9B19-98BBEE6454BE", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "DEC7345C-A4FF-45D3-B147-5CBD92B3375C", "text": "{\"medicalCases\":[],\"medications\":[{\"ossFileId\":286,\"displayName\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"普南扑灵\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日四次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"5ml:5mg\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"4\\\"}\",\"id\":\"EA4134C8-5084-4F6E-A8FD-AC326A61F93E\",\"specification\":\"5ml:5mg 滴眼液\",\"dosageLine\":\"1滴 · 每日四次\",\"memberID\":21,\"isSaved\":true},{\"ossFileId\":286,\"displayName\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\",\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"爱赛平\\\",\\\"dosageForm\\\":\\\"滴眼液\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"drugName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\\\",\\\"frequencyCode\\\":\\\"bid\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日两次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"6ml:3mg 0.05%\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"2\\\"}\",\"id\":\"8B94B43B-6167-426B-B068-D2A92B095370\",\"specification\":\"6ml:3mg 0.05% 滴眼液\",\"dosageLine\":\"1滴 · 每日两次\",\"memberID\":21,\"isSaved\":true}],\"prescriptions\":[],\"examReports\":[]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
