INFO 2026-04-22 12:27:23,606 accounts.api_io [request_id=03082020-7479-429F-9D9B-0AE37AAF1184] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=6 bytes=4037 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjJUMDk6MzE6MTguODAyMTYxKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMzgwIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "65da59f6-5f94-4866-90fb-5d3d2765d1fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "5ee6af7c-62e2-4f8a-aa1b-38af14c16720", "server_message_id": "ac3df86e-5a4b-4f06-acb3-3039225bfb6b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T09:28:58.411000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T09:28:58.455015+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "65da59f6-5f94-4866-90fb-5d3d2765d1fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "看看", "client_message_id": "6c9844cf-e6bb-4940-83f0-93c614572a82", "server_message_id": "aafc084e-4c7e-4263-a24e-e09a5f0a21fe", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T09:30:56.888000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T09:30:56.954452+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "7FF32FBD-84AE-40BD-94DE-7050534ABA3A", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260422/E938C42A-F2C1-4498-BA06-76E1531345DA/IMG_1806.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 307, "fileMd5": "4890f149d00377b5e0fbbceee9bdf375", "fullCacheKey": "e938c42a-f2c1-4498-ba06-76e1531345da/IMG_1806.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "65da59f6-5f94-4866-90fb-5d3d2765d1fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "从照片来看，你的上肢皮肤出现了多处形态不规则的淡红色斑片，边界相对清楚，没有明显破溃或渗出，这类表现最常见于**过敏性皮炎/荨麻疹（风团）**，也可能是接触性皮炎、蚊虫叮咬反应或其他红斑性皮肤问题。\n\n### 当下可先做这些处理：\n1.  **避免刺激**：不要抓挠红斑部位，避免用热水烫洗，暂时停用可能致敏的身体乳、护肤品，穿宽松纯棉衣物减少摩擦。\n2.  **观察诱因**：回忆最近是否接触过新的物品（如新衣服、洗涤剂、植物）、吃了特殊食物/药物、去过蚊虫多的地方，帮助判断过敏原因。\n3.  **缓解症状**：如果瘙痒明显，可先外用炉甘石洗剂（无破溃时用），或口服常用的抗组胺药（如氯雷他定、西替利嗪，按说明书服用）。\n4.  **及时就医信号**：如果红斑持续24小时不消退、越来越多，伴随瘙痒加重、疼痛、发热、呼吸困难等不适，请立即到皮肤科就诊，明确病因后针对性用药。\n\n你目前有没有瘙痒、疼痛的感觉？这些红斑出现多久了呢？", "client_message_id": "fbe4563b-43b3-4f99-b4f0-99125a4b99a3", "server_message_id": "afceee04-cb2f-4c54-839a-520bb1755413", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-22T09:31:18.774000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-22T09:31:18.802161+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "9B0DFE33-8B95-4BA4-894C-F7F2C1CFE9D1", "text": "search_online", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "84AD7480-2905-484E-BEE6-6D5E23CB4BE5", "text": "[1] search_online\n工具 search_online 已接入 SparkClient 路由。\nendpoint=未配置\nargs=query=胳膊皮肤出现多发红色斑疹 形态不规则 无破溃 可能病因 处理建议\n当前为本地执行占位；如需真实联网调用，请在对应 toolClass 网关实现 HTTP 适配。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "D29CCF92-422F-4797-AE29-4A5F4B98019B", "text": "正在使用工具：search_online", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "499C4D2D-83E9-4276-A48E-C7F70A5B9023", "text": "工具 search_online 已接入 SparkClient 路由。\nendpoint=未配置\nargs=query=胳膊皮肤出现多发红色斑疹 形态不规则 无破溃 可能病因 处理建议\n当前为本地执行占位；如需真实联网调用，请在对应 toolClass 网关实现 HTTP 适配。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
